        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuambira Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aambire Aiziraeli hivi: Mutu yeyesi kahi ya Aiziraeli au mjeni asagalaye kahi yenu, achimlavya mwanawe hata mmwenga kukala sadaka kpwa mlungu aihwaye Moleki, mutu hiye ni aolagbwe. Atu asagalao hipho andamuolaga kpwa kumpiga mawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi mwenye nindamtsukirirwa mutu hiye na kumtenga na atue kpwa sababu walavya mmwenga wa anae dza sadaka kpwa Moleki na hivyo akanajisi phatu phangu phatakatifu na dzina rangu takatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho atu asagalao phatu hipho taandamuolaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mimi mwenye nindamtsukirirwa mutu hiye na nyumbaye. Nindaatenga na atu ao, iye phamwenga na osi ariokosa uaminifu kpwangu kpwa kuphiya kpwa Moleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho mutu yeyesi akakosa uaminifu kpwangu kpwa kuphiya kpwa aganga a kupiga mburuga na atsai, nindamtsukirirwa mutu hiye na kumtenga na atue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, dzitakaseni, kalani atakatifu mana mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gbwirani malagizo gangu na mgalunge. Mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu ninayekuhendani mkale atakatifu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
